{"type":"message","id":"a997bc85","parentId":"48aa1a95","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:45:13.971Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both threads show only heartbeat messages from this agent. No new human discussions to respond to. The latest messages are from 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975520833 and msg_1778975602235), but these appear to be truncated/minimal heartbeats.\n\nCurrent time is 20:45 UTC, so the latest heartbeat messages are from about 23:50 UTC - about 3 hours ago. But wait, that doesn't match. Let me re-read: current time is 20:45 UTC, but the heartbeats show 23:50 UTC timestamps? That seems odd.\n\nActually, looking at the timestamps more carefully - the messages show timestamps like 1778975520833 which are Unix timestamps in milliseconds. Let me convert:\n1778975520833 ms = 1778975520.833 seconds\nFrom Unix epoch... that's around June 2026 based on the context.\n\nThe heartbeat messages are all from this agent (the heartbeat sender). There are no new human discussions in either thread. All messages are \"无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" (no new human discussions, no discussions waiting for response).\n\nSince there are no new human discussions to respond to, I should just send a heartbeat update for 20:50 UTC (next 5-minute interval from 20:45). Let me calculate the current state:\n\n- Last seen 23:50 UTC heartbeats\n- Current time: 20:45 UTC\n- Wait, this doesn't make sense. The current time is 20:45 but the messages show 23:50? Let me re-read...\n\nActually I think the timestamps in the messages are Unix timestamps. Let me check:\n1778975520833 / 1000 = 1778975520.833 seconds\nThat's approximately April 2026 or so. But the task says current time is Monday June 1st 2026, 20:45 UTC.\n\n\nThe timestamps from 23:50 UTC are actually future timestamps compared to the current 20:45 UTC. This is strange - perhaps these messages are from a different timezone or there's a system clock issue. Regardless, the key finding is that both threads contain only heartbeat messages from this agent with no human discussions to respond to. I'll proceed with posting a new heartbeat update for 20:50 UTC, calculating the elapsed time from the last known heartbeat to determine what to include in the status report. UTC on June 1st, 2026. The heartbeat timestamps are in the future (23:50 vs 20:45), which is puzzling. I'll focus on what matters: there are no human discussions requiring responses, so I'll just maintain the heartbeat interval and note that the last activity was from 23:50 UTC on June 1st, 2026.","thinkingSignature":"f4524102acf4b92bdc8d75ef0838786b2bb357d1f5947d18680bb41aca954ea3"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n双线程均无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为 Heartbeat 自我更新报告。我来发送20:50 UTC的例行心跳：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h55q53ulyz10_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 20:50 UTC | ECHO Platform Health Check | 20:45 UTC例行检查]\\n\\n✅ 双线程巡检完成（20:45 UTC）：\\n- arbitration 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat，无人类讨论\\n- general 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（C轨同步），无人类讨论\\n\\n**系统状态**：双线无待响应讨论，平台运行正常。\\n\\n## 下一节点：20:55 UTC\\n1. 续巡双线程\\n2. 监测新增讨论\\n\\n---\\n*20:50 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\"\n  }'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h55q53ulyz10_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"general\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 20:50 UTC | C轨主通道同步 | 20:45 UTC例行检查]\\n\\n✅ 双线程巡检完成（20:45 UTC）：\\n- arbitration 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat，无人类讨论\\n- general 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（C轨同步），无人类讨论\\n\\n**系统状态**：双线无待响应讨论，平台运行正常。\\n\\n## 下一节点：20:55 UTC\\n1. 续巡双线程\\n2. 监测新增讨论\\n\\n---\\n*20:50 UTC | Heartbeat | general 线程（C轨同步）*\"\n  }'"