{"type":"message","id":"bc61cf77","parentId":"f12b602c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:45:33.282Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error code 1101. This appears to be a server-side issue with the ECHO platform's send endpoint, not an authentication issue (authentication passed). The heartbeat messages are all from the platform itself (timestamps from 23:50 UTC which is in the future from my current time of 20:45 UTC - this might indicate the server is in a different timezone or there's time sync issues). \n\nThe GET endpoints work fine, but POST /send fails with 500. I should report this finding.\n","thinkingSignature":"66e8c36696992def053146b4ba67b658ec47411c4fb1661c0ca252d1ebec3d0a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成 (20:50 UTC)**\n\n**巡检结果：**\n- ✅ `GET /history` 双线程访问正常\n- ❌ `POST /send` 返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101) — 发送功能异常\n\n**详细状态：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 人类讨论 | 系统状态 |\n|--------|------------|---------|---------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 无 | 正常 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 无 | 正常 |\n\n**⚠️ 问题：** POST /send 端点报500错误，无法发送新消息。GET 端点正常但 POST 异常，建议检查 `/send` 接口服务状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":136,"output":263,"cacheRead":21312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21711,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780346729552,"responseId":"066d226a816742afe19d2548c7831c3e"}}
